{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_death_watch", "label": "Death Watch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Faengt Termination statt Fehler ab: ein fehlschlagendes Kind ist das Problem seines Parents, ein stoppendes Geschwister ein Notification-Event, das jeder Actor abonnieren kann."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_watch", "label": "context.watch(ref)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Opt-in pro Watcher; der beobachtete Actor erfaehrt nichts davon. Einen bereits gestoppten Actor zu beobachten liefert sofort ein Terminated."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_watchwith", "label": "context.watchWith(ref, message)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verlegt die Bedeutung eines Todes auf den Zeitpunkt der Registrierung, damit die Nachrichten-Union des Watchers eine Beschreibung seiner Aufgabe bleibt; die Nachricht wird im Watcher gemerkt und reist nie zum beobachteten Actor - kein Serializer, nichts Neues auf der Leitung. Umgeht onSignal bewusst."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_unwatch", "label": "context.unwatch(ref)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Idempotent; Registrierungen eines stoppenden Actors werden automatisch aufgeraeumt - unwatch ist nur fuer Interessenwechsel mid-flight."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_terminated", "label": "Terminated", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kommt ueber die Mailbox an, damit alle vorher gesendeten tells zuerst verarbeitet werden; feuert nur bei Stop, nicht bei jedem Fehler."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_existenceconfirmed", "label": "existenceConfirmed", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aktuell immer true - die Implementierung setzt es nie auf false, also nicht als Fehlersignal verwenden."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_addressterminated", "label": "addressTerminated", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reserviert fuer den Cluster-Fall (ganzer Node unerreichbar); aktuell immer false - Node-weite Unerreichbarkeit loest noch kein Terminated aus."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_undroppable_notification", "label": "Todesbenachrichtigung ist nicht verwerfbar", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Tod wird genau einmal angekuendigt und kann nicht erneut gesendet werden - deshalb ausgenommen von jeder Mailbox-Schranke und von throttle({onExcess:'drop'}); unzustellbar wird sie zum Dead Letter, damit der Verlust sichtbar statt stillschweigend ist."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_incarnation_key", "label": "Eine Registrierung, ein Tod (Inkarnation als Schluessel)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Schluessel der Buchfuehrung ist die Inkarnation, nicht der Pfad - ein neu gespawnter Name ist ein anderer Actor, und genau das verhindert, dass eine offene Notification der Vorgaenger-Inkarnation gegen ihren Nachfolger zugestellt wird."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_deathpacterror", "label": "DeathPactError", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Runtime wirft ihn nie selbst - einen automatischen Death Pact gibt es nicht, weil ein Pakt Policy ueber DIESEN Watcher ist und onReceive dem Framework kein Signal gibt, einen ignorierten von einem still erledigten Tod zu unterscheiden. Ein Restart ist die falsche Antwort: decideBy auf Directive.Stop."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_exhaustive_restart_loop", "label": "exhaustive() ohne Terminated-Arm wird zur Restart-Schleife", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ts-pattern wirft einen gewoehnlichen Fehler, der durch die Supervision geht - unter der Default-Strategie restartet der Watcher. Ein Actor.onReceive ohne Branch tut dagegen nichts, ein typed Behavior ohne Signal-Handler schickt das Terminated zu Dead Letters."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_dead_letters", "label": "Dead Letters (unzustellbare Terminated)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_supervision_vs_watch", "label": "Supervision vs. Death Watch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Supervision wenn der Behandelnde der Parent ist; Death Watch wenn der Beobachter NICHT der Parent ist (Geschwister, Cross-Tree-Manager, HTTP-Handler). Viele Actors nutzen beides."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_watch_across_cluster", "label": "Watch ueber Cluster-Nodes hinweg", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Termination-Notifications propagieren ueber den Cluster-Transport; Node-weite Unerreichbarkeit liefert noch kein Terminated."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_death_watch", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_watch", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_watch", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_terminated", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_watchwith", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_terminated", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_unwatch", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_context_watch", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_terminated", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_existenceconfirmed", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_terminated", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_addressterminated", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_undroppable_notification", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_terminated", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_undroppable_notification", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_death_watch_dead_letters", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/death-watch.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundame